# No credentials: one Node.js instance persists rooms in this directory.
# Mount a persistent volume here on your hosting provider. Never run multiple
# instances against this JSON directory. Rooms expire after 7 days; remove expired
# files through your host retention job. No student emails or IDs are collected.
ROOM_DATA_DIR=.data

# Optional: use a dedicated Firebase Realtime Database for shared instances.
# Set BOTH values on the server only; never prefix these with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Deploy database.rules.json to deny all direct client access.
# Admin credentials bypass these rules; protect the hosting environment.
# FIREBASE_DATABASE_URL=https://YOUR-DEDICATED-DB.firebasedatabase.app
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account","project_id":"...","private_key":"...","client_email":"..."}
